              "text": "Where you can order a birthday cake online depends on your location and how quickly you need it. \n\nThe best options are categorized below by region and delivery speed:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 Best in the United States (Nationwide Shipping)\nIf you want to ship a premium, gourmet cake to someone anywhere in the U.S., these highly-rated services specialize in overnight or scheduled nationwide shipping:\n\n*   **[Goldbelly](https://www.goldbelly.com):** This is the ultimate platform for food lovers. It allows you to order famous birthday cakes from legendary bakeries across the country\u2014like **Magnolia Bakery** (NYC), **Carlo\u2019s Bakery** (from TLC's *Cake Boss*), or **Duff Goldman's Charm City Cakes**. \n*   **[Milk Bar](https://milkbarstore.com):** Famous for its iconic, unfrosted-sided \"naked\" Vanilla Birthday Cake, cake truffles, and pies. Their cakes are shipped frozen in insulated boxes and arrive looking (and tasting) spectacular.\n*   **[SusieCakes](https://susiecakes.com):** Known for classic, nostalgic American birthday cakes made from scratch. They ship their best-selling celebration layer cakes nationwide.\n*   **[Send A Cake](https://sendacake.com):** Perfect if you want to send a unique, fun gift. They specialize in \"explosion boxes\" where a mini cake is housed in a box that showers the recipient with flying paper butterflies, faux flowers, or candy when opened.\n*   **[Bake Me A Wish](https://www.bakemeawish.com) / [Harry & David](https://www.harryanddavid.com):** Great for reliable, traditional, and delicious birthday cakes shipped with guaranteed overnight delivery. \n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7 Best in the United Kingdom (Nationwide Shipping)\nIf you are ordering within the UK, these online bakeries offer incredible nationwide courier delivery:\n\n*   **[Cutter & Squidge](https://cutterandsquidge.com):** Widely rated as one of the best overall cake delivery services in the UK. They make beautiful, all-natural celebration cakes with fast delivery.\n*   **[Lola\u2019s Cupcakes](https://www.lolascupcakes.co.uk):** While famous for their cupcakes, they also deliver stunning, handcrafted full birthday cakes nationwide.\n*   **[Cake Box](https://www.eggfreecake.co.uk):** An excellent choice if you need a high-quality, **egg-free** birthday cake. They have over 300 branches and offer easy online ordering for collection or delivery.\n*   **[Patisserie Valerie](https://www.patisserie-valerie.co.uk):** Perfect for premium, classic birthday cakes like Red Velvet, Chocolate, or strawberry gateaux delivered straight to your door.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\ude97 Same-Day & Local Delivery (Worldwide)\nIf you need a cake delivered **today** or tomorrow, nationwide shipping won't work. Instead, use local delivery platforms to source from bakeries near you:\n\n*   **On-Demand Delivery Apps (DoorDash, Uber Eats, Deliveroo, Glovo, Bolt Food):** Simply open your favorite food delivery app, search for \"bakery\" or \"cake,\" and you can order a fresh cake from a nearby local shop to be delivered in under an hour.\n*   **Instacart / Grocery Delivery Apps:** If you want a more budget-friendly option (like a classic supermarket sheet cake), you can use Instacart or your local grocery store's delivery service to order a cake from the bakery department of stores like Whole Foods, Safeway, or Tesco. \n*   **Local Flower & Gift Delivery Sites:** In many countries, national flower networks (like *1-800-Flowers* in the US, *Interflora* in the UK, or *Floria/Magazinul de Flori* in mainland Europe) offer add-on gourmet birthday cakes that can be hand-delivered locally.\n\n**Tip for ordering online:** Cakes shipped nationwide are typically frozen and packed with dry ice to keep them fresh. Be sure to check the delivery date and factor in **2 to 4 hours of defrosting time** before the party starts!",
